      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "La última vez, el espíritu de Pele viajó en sueños hasta Kauaʻi y se enamoró del jefe Lohiʻau.",
          "en": "Last time, Pele's spirit traveled in a dream to Kauaʻi and fell in love with the chief Lohiʻau."
        },
        {
          "es": "Ella no sabía que Lohiʻau ya había muerto de tristeza.",
          "en": "She did not know that Lohiʻau had already died of sorrow."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pele llamó a sus hermanas, una por una. «Vayan a Kauaʻi y tráiganme a Lohiʻau», les pidió.",
          "en": "Pele called her sisters, one by one. \"Go to Kauaʻi and bring me Lohiʻau,\" she said."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero todas dijeron que no. El camino era largo y peligroso, y le tenían miedo a los celos de Pele.",
          "en": "But they all said no. The road was long and dangerous, and they feared Pele's jealousy."
        }
      ],
