          1,
          1.05
        ]
      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Pele estaba tan impaciente que la echó sin comida y sin ropa de viaje.",
          "en": "Pele was so impatient that she sent her off with no food and no traveling clothes."
        },
        {
          "es": "Hiʻiaka trepó la pared del cráter, y desde arriba cantó una despedida.",
          "en": "Hiʻiaka climbed the crater wall, and from the top she sang a farewell."
        },
        {
          "es": "«Me voy a buscar al amado de tus sueños. Ay, mi bosque de lehua...»",
          "en": "\"I go to find the lover of your dreams. Oh, my lehua forest...\""
        },
        {
          "es": "Al oírla, Pele se ablandó. Le dio parte de su poder de diosa.",
          "en": "Hearing her, Pele softened. She gave her part of her divine power."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y le dio una falda mágica, una pāʻū que guardaba adentro el poder del rayo.",
          "en": "And she gave her a magic skirt, a pāʻū that held the power of lightning inside it."
        },
        {
          "es": "Con esa falda podría vencer a los monstruos que la esperaban en el camino.",
          "en": "With that skirt, she could strike down the monsters waiting on the road."
        }
      ],
