      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "En el bosque se encontraron con una mujer que llevaba un cerdito negro y un pez gruñón.",
          "en": "In the forest, they met a woman carrying a little black pig and a grunting fish."
        },
        {
          "es": "Eran ofrendas para Pele. La mujer se llamaba Wahineʻōmaʻo.",
          "en": "They were offerings for Pele. The woman's name was Wahineʻōmaʻo."
        },
        {
          "es": "Al ver a Hiʻiaka quiso ir con ella. «Primero lleva tu ofrenda al cráter», le dijo Hiʻiaka.",
          "en": "When she saw Hiʻiaka, she wanted to go with her. \"First take your offering to the crater,\" said Hiʻiaka."
        },
        {
          "es": "Wahineʻōmaʻo corrió al volcán y tiró el cerdito al fuego.",
          "en": "Wahineʻōmaʻo ran to the volcano and threw the little pig into the fire."
        }
